  "_comment": "ACNABIN relevance rules. All patterns are case-insensitive regular expressions matched on word boundaries. 'phrases' are matched against the listing title/description; 'document_phrases' are also matched against tender document text (keep these specific, because tender documents contain boilerplate such as 'audited financial statements of the bidder').",
